48944912/premier-league-efl-summer-transfer-window-2026-dates-does-open-deadline-day\">Premier League, EFL summer transfer window 2026 dates: When is Deadline Day?</a></h2><p>Everything that Premier League and EFL supporters need to know about the 2026 summer transfer window, and key dates around it.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:3\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/49154575/premier-league-preseason-friendlies-202627-fixtures-uk-kickoff-s-summer-tour-schedule-chelsea-liverpool-arsenal-man-united-man-city-spurs\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0623%2Fr1678163_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0623%2Fr1678163_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0623%2Fr1678163_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0623%2Fr1678163_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0623/r1678163_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Alex Livesey - Danehouse/Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49154575\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49154575:3\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/49154575/premier-league-preseason-friendlies-202627-fixtures-uk-kickoff-s-summer-tour-schedule-chelsea-liverpool-arsenal-man-united-man-city-spurs\">Premier League preseason friendlies 2026-27: Fixtures, UK kick-off times and summer tour schedule</a></h2><p>Premier League clubs have confirmed their preseason schedules ahead of the new campaign, with the 2026-27 season kicking off on Aug. 21.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:4\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/45278453/disney+-becomes-new-home-women-champions-league-europe\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0524%2Fr1497653_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0524%2Fr1497653_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0524%2Fr1497653_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0524%2Fr1497653_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2025/0524/r1497653_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Alex Burstow/Arsenal FC via Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"45278453\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:45278453:4\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/45278453/disney+-becomes-new-home-women-champions-league-europe\">Disney+ becomes new home of Women's Champions League in Europe</a></h2><p>Disney+ will be the home of the UEFA Women's Champions League in Europe from next season after securing rights to the competition for the next five years.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:5\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/45918441/disney+-show-prime-laliga-games-uk-ireland\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0807%2Fr1528841_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0807%2Fr1528841_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0807%2Fr1528841_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a3.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0807%2Fr1528841_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2025/0807/r1528841_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Pedro Salado/Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"45918441\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:45918441:5\" href=\"/football/story/_/id/45918441/disney+-show-prime-laliga-games-uk-ireland\">Disney+ to show primetime LaLiga games in UK and Ireland</a></h2><p>Disney+ will be the home of LaLiga's primetime weekend matches after securing a three-year deal to exclusively show the division's Saturday night kick-off.</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:6\" href=\"/football/fixtures\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a1.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0623%2Fr1510360_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a1.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0623%2Fr1510360_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a1.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2025%2F0623%2Fr1510360_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&